  "description": "In her late-twenties, Gayeong’s work, love, and life are all in ruins. After getting dumped by her boyfriend and crying herself to sleep, she wakes up eight years earlier, when she was still in high school. Is this a dream? This time, will she be able to win in work, love, and life?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3155964)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7056), [Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0CMHB8BT4/)",
